  layout: |
    Alternating rows: even=pipe(bg=8), odd=wall(all 0 except gates).
    Last row (even) is pipe with no edge tokens. All other pipe rows
    have token=3 at col 0 and col W-1 (2 tokens per non-last pipe row).
  gates:
    shape: 1x3 horizontal bar of color 7 in wall rows
    count_per_wall: 0-3
    total: 6-12 across all wall rows
    center_col: 2 to W-3 (flanks stay interior to grid)
